      "created_at": "2014-05-27T18:44:00.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Destroy means go to the trash from play.</p><p>Discard means go to the trash from your hand.</p><p>Both get recirculated.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>There are very few times something will be permanently removed from play, and not recirculated.. For those situations, the cards will explicitly say so.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
