      "can_recover": false,
      "can_see_hidden_post": false,
      "can_wiki": false,
      "read": false,
      "user_title": null,
      "bookmarked": false,
      "raw": "<p>Sometimes cards say &quot;discard the top card of your deck.&quot;&nbsp;</p><p style=\"font-size: 13px; line-height: 20px;\">So, since this has become a place to discuss the most particularly specific semantics, we should update the definition of Discard and Destroy.</p><p style=\"font-size: 13px; line-height: 20px;\">Discard- When a card not yet revealed (face-down) card is placed into the appropriate Trash.</p><p style=\"font-size: 13px; line-height: 20px;\">Destroy- When a revealed (face-up) card is placed into the appropriate Trash.</p>",
