      "created_at": "2014-07-26T15:06:25.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>That doesn't fit, because cards in your hand are face-up and yet they get <span class=\"bbcode-i\">discarded</span> when going to the trash, not destroyed. Also, sometimes a card/power will require you to \"reveal the top X cards of your deck\" and then discard one/some of them (for example Arcane Cadence or Research Grant).</p>",
